----------------------------------------
`engine/vendor/vdecoder/hifigan/` is the NSF HiFiGAN decoder that so-vits-svc
bundles. Its original upstream is:
  https://github.com/openvpi/DiffSinger  (modules/nsf_hifigan)
It reached this repository through (1), under (1)'s MIT license file.


3. HuBERT-Soft content encoder — MIT, bshall/hubert
---------------------------------------------------
`engine/vendor/hubert/hubert_model.py` is the pure-PyTorch HuBERT-Soft model
definition bundled by (1). The checkpoint `hubert-soft-0d54a1f4.pt` is NOT
included; download it from:
